---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Nav from '../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import PhonePreview from '../components/PhonePreview.astro';
---
<Layout>
  <Nav />

  <!-- ================== HERO ================== -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <span class="tag"><span class="tag-dot"></span>Now in beta · iOS + Android</span>
      <h1 class="display">Reply faster.<br />Win more jobs.</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        Foremann gives you a real business phone number that drafts every reply
        in your voice — so the job goes to you, not the contractor who answered
        first. Built for plumbers, electricians, HVAC techs, landscapers, and
        tradespeople who run their own operation.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-ctas">
        <a href="#get" class="btn btn-primary">Get your business number</a>
        <a href="#how" class="btn btn-secondary">See how it works</a>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-note">No contracts · Cancel anytime · Beta pricing locked in · Setup in 5 minutes</div>
    </div>

    <div class="preview">
      <PhonePreview />
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ================== PROBLEM ================== -->
  <section class="alt" id="problem">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div class="eyebrow">The problem</div>
        <h2 class="heading-xl">You're the owner, the crew, and the foreman.<br />Something has to give — and it's usually the phone.</h2>
        <p class="lede">Every solo contractor we've talked to has the same three stories.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid">
        <div class="card">
          <div class="num">01</div>
          <h3>The three-hour reply</h3>
          <p>You see the text after the job wraps up. By then she's already hired the other guy who answered in ten minutes.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <div class="num">02</div>
          <h3>The dropped follow-up</h3>
          <p>You quoted the deck rebuild two weeks ago and never heard back. You meant to check in. You didn't. That's revenue on the table.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <div class="num">03</div>
          <h3>The 10pm text</h3>
          <p>Clients have your cell. Your partner is sick of it. There's no off switch between "the business" and "you".</p>
          <p class="card-note">Foremann doesn't answer it for you. It drafts your reply and holds it until morning.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ================== HOW IT WORKS ================== -->
  <section id="how">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div class="eyebrow">How it works</div>
        <h2 class="heading-xl">We set up your foreman in five minutes.<br />You win jobs the same day.</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="steps">
        <div class="step">
          <h3>We get you a business phone line</h3>
          <p>Pick an area code, we buy the number and set it up. Your clients text it. Your personal phone never rings for work again.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <h3>We tailor it to how you work</h3>
          <p>Tell us your trade, your service area, and how you talk. We train your foreman to sound like you — not like a chatbot.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <h3>Send in thirty seconds</h3>
          <p>Every inbound text arrives with a ready-to-send draft. Tap edit or tap send. You're out the door before the competition wakes up.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ================== FEATURES ================== -->
  <section class="ink-section" id="features">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div class="eyebrow">What your foreman does</div>
        <h2 class="heading-xl">A second pair of hands that never takes a day off.</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="grid">

        <!-- Lead Sources -->
        <div class="card feat-card">
          <div class="feat-visual">
            <div class="fv-lead-source">
              <span class="fv-lead-badge">Angi lead</span>
              <span class="fv-lead-job">Deck repair · Phoenix, AZ</span>
            </div>
            <div class="fv-ai">
              <span class="fv-ai-label">Draft ready · 8 seconds</span>
              <span class="fv-ai-msg">Hi — I do deck repair in Phoenix and can come take a look this week. What days work?</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="num feat-coming">Lead sources</div>
          <h3>First reply on Angi, Yelp, and Thumbtack — every time.</h3>
          <p>Forward your lead notification emails to Foremann. Your foreman reads the lead and drafts your outreach before the other contractor has typed "Hello."</p>
          <span class="feat-tag">Coming next</span>
        </div>

        <!-- AI Draft -->
        <div class="card feat-card">
          <div class="feat-visual">
            <div class="fv-bubble fv-in">Any chance you can do next Tuesday?</div>
            <div class="fv-ai">
              <span class="fv-ai-label">AI Draft</span>
              <span class="fv-ai-msg">Tuesday works — I can be there by 8. Does that work?</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="num">AI Draft</div>
          <h3>A reply ready on every text</h3>
          <p>Your foreman reads the thread and drafts a response that sounds like you sent it. You review, tweak, send. Never a blank page. Average review time: under 10 seconds.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Follow-ups -->
        <div class="card feat-card">
          <div class="feat-visual">
            <div class="fv-bubble fv-out">Sent you the quote — let me know!</div>
            <div class="fv-gap">3 days · no reply</div>
            <div class="fv-ai">
              <span class="fv-ai-label">Follow-up ready</span>
              <span class="fv-ai-msg">Hey — just wanted to check in on that quote. Any questions?</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="num">Follow-ups</div>
          <h3>Stale quotes, caught.</h3>
          <p>When a client hasn't replied in 48 hours, your foreman drafts a check-in. The average missed follow-up costs contractors $800–2,400 in lost revenue.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Summaries -->
        <div class="card feat-card">
          <div class="feat-visual">
            <div class="fv-sum-label">Client Summary</div>
            <div class="fv-sum-row">
              <span class="fv-sum-name">Tom Braxton</span>
              <span class="fv-sum-meta">14 jobs · $5,200</span>
            </div>
            <div class="fv-sum-text">Wants gutters cleaned before rain season. Quoted $180. Waiting on his schedule — prefers weekend mornings.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="num">Summaries</div>
          <h3>Long threads at a glance</h3>
          <p>Two sentences that tell you who this client is, what they want, and what to do next. Scroll saved, context kept.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Your voice -->
        <div class="card feat-card">
          <div class="feat-visual">
            <div class="fv-compare">
              <div>
                <div class="fv-compare-label">Generic AI</div>
                <div class="fv-bubble fv-out fv-dull">Hello, I will be available on Friday afternoon.</div>
              </div>
              <div>
                <div class="fv-compare-label active">Your foreman</div>
                <div class="fv-bubble fv-out">Friday works — I'll be there around 2. See you then 👍</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="num">Your voice</div>
          <h3>Trained on how you talk</h3>
          <p>Formality, length, phrases you always use, phrases you'd never use. Your foreman matches you — it doesn't make you sound like a robot.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Text-only line -->
        <div class="card feat-card">
          <div class="feat-visual fv-call">
            <div class="fv-call-icon">📵</div>
            <div class="fv-call-num">(415) 555-0182 · calling...</div>
            <div class="fv-call-redirect">"Please text this number instead — we'll get back to you shortly."</div>
            <div class="fv-call-badge">Auto-redirected</div>
          </div>
          <div class="num">Text-only line</div>
          <h3>Calls go to a polite redirect</h3>
          <p>Inbound callers hear "please text this number instead." Your phone doesn't ring. Your day doesn't get interrupted. Smart call handling coming next.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Work / life -->
        <div class="card feat-card">
          <div class="feat-visual" style="justify-content:center;gap:10px;">
            <div class="fv-line">
              <div class="fv-line-icon">💼</div>
              <div class="fv-line-info">
                <div class="fv-line-label">Business line</div>
                <div class="fv-line-num">(720) 555-0191</div>
              </div>
              <div class="fv-line-badge on">Active</div>
            </div>
            <div class="fv-divider"></div>
            <div class="fv-line">
              <div class="fv-line-icon">🔒</div>
              <div class="fv-line-info">
                <div class="fv-line-label">Personal number</div>
                <div class="fv-line-num">Never shared</div>
              </div>
              <div class="fv-line-badge">Private</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="num">Work / life</div>
          <h3>Clean separation from day one</h3>
          <p>Clients only have the business number. Nothing hits your personal phone. Notifications off when you want them off.</p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ================== ROADMAP PEEK ================== -->
  <section class="alt" id="next">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div class="eyebrow-muted">What's next</div>
        <h2 class="heading-xl">Starting with the phone.<br />Ending with the whole front office.</h2>
        <p class="lede">
          Foremann is the communication layer first because the phone is where you're
          losing the most money today. But a real foreman handles more than texts —
          and so will yours.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid">
        <div class="card">
          <div class="num">Now</div>
          <h3>Texts, AI drafts, follow-ups</h3>
          <p>Every inbound text arrives with a ready-to-send reply in your voice. Stale threads get surfaced before they go cold.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <div class="num">Next</div>
          <h3>Calls, voicemail triage</h3>
          <p>Your foreman answers when you can't — takes a message, captures the ask, drafts the callback or text. You see it when you get off the ladder.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <div class="num">After</div>
          <h3>Scheduling, quotes, invoices</h3>
          <p>From the same thread that booked the job, your foreman pulls dates onto a calendar, drafts the quote, sends the invoice when the work is done.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ================== TESTIMONIALS ================== -->
  <section id="testimonials">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div class="eyebrow">What contractors are saying</div>
        <h2 class="heading-xl">Real results from real jobs.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="grid testimonial-grid">
        <div class="card testimonial-card">
          <p class="testimonial-quote">"I used to take 20 minutes to respond to a new lead because I was always on a job. Now I see the draft and hit send in ten seconds. Already closed two jobs I probably would have lost."</p>
          <div class="testimonial-attr">
            <div class="testimonial-name">Mike</div>
            <div class="testimonial-trade">Electrician · Austin, TX</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="card testimonial-card">
          <p class="testimonial-quote">"The follow-up thing is what got me. I quoted a deck rebuild and forgot. Two weeks later Foremann drafted a check-in. The client said 'glad you followed up' and booked."</p>
          <div class="testimonial-attr">
            <div class="testimonial-name">Jason</div>
            <div class="testimonial-trade">General Contractor · Denver, CO</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="card testimonial-card">
          <p class="testimonial-quote">"My wife kept asking why clients were texting me at 10pm. Now they have the business number. Problem solved."</p>
          <div class="testimonial-attr">
            <div class="testimonial-name">Carlos</div>
            <div class="testimonial-trade">HVAC Tech · Phoenix, AZ</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ================== PRICING ================== -->
  <section id="pricing">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div class="eyebrow">Pricing</div>
        <h2 class="heading-xl">Priced like a tool, not a phone bill.</h2>
        <p class="lede">One job pays for a month. Lock in your rate — cancel anytime.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="pricing">
        <div class="price-card">
          <div class="price-name">Solo</div>
          <div class="price-persona">Running your own jobs, no dispatcher.</div>
          <div>
            <span class="price-amount">$29</span>
            <span class="price-period">/ mo</span>
          </div>
          <ul class="price-features">
            <li>One business number</li>
            <li>200 AI draft replies / month</li>
            <li>Unlimited inbound SMS</li>
            <li>iOS + Android apps</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="mailto:hi@foremann.app?subject=Beta%20access%20%E2%80%94%20Solo" class="btn btn-secondary price-cta">Get your business number</a>
        </div>

        <div class="price-card featured">
          <div class="price-badge">Most popular</div>
          <div class="price-name">Active</div>
          <div class="price-persona">Busy enough that every lead counts.</div>
          <div>
            <span class="price-amount">$69</span>
            <span class="price-period">/ mo</span>
          </div>
          <ul class="price-features">
            <li>Everything in Solo</li>
            <li>600 AI draft replies / month</li>
            <li>AI conversation summaries</li>
            <li>Smart follow-up suggestions</li>
            <li>Priority support</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="mailto:hi@foremann.app?subject=Beta%20access%20%E2%80%94%20Active" class="btn btn-primary price-cta">Get your business number</a>
        </div>

        <div class="price-card">
          <div class="price-name">Crew</div>
          <div class="price-persona">Multiple people handling the same phone line.</div>
          <div>
            <span class="price-amount">$229</span>
            <span class="price-period">/ mo</span>
          </div>
          <ul class="price-features">
            <li>Up to 5 contractors</li>
            <li>2,000 AI draft replies / month</li>
            <li>Shared inbox</li>
            <li>Admin dashboard</li>
            <li>Priority support</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="mailto:hi@foremann.app?subject=Beta%20access%20%E2%80%94%20Crew" class="btn btn-secondary price-cta">Get your business number</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ================== FAQ ================== -->
  <section class="alt" id="faq">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div class="eyebrow">Common questions</div>
        <h2 class="heading-xl">Good questions deserve straight answers.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-list">

        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary class="faq-q">Does the AI reply to my clients automatically?</summary>
          <div class="faq-a">
            <p>No — you always approve before anything sends. The AI drafts a reply in your voice; you review it, edit if needed, and tap send. Your clients always hear from you, not a bot.</p>
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary class="faq-q">What if the AI draft doesn't sound right?</summary>
          <div class="faq-a">
            <p>Edit it before sending — it's just a starting point, not an autopilot. The more you fill in your AI profile (tone, phrases you use, phrases you'd never say), the better the drafts get. Most contractors find the drafts usable within the first day.</p>
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary class="faq-q">Do I keep my current phone number?</summary>
          <div class="faq-a">
            <p>You get a second dedicated business number — Foremann doesn't replace your personal number. Clients only have the business line. Your personal phone stays clean.</p>
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary class="faq-q">Does it work on Android?</summary>
          <div class="faq-a">
            <p>Yes. iOS and Android apps available. Download the Foremann app and sign up — your number is provisioned inside the app in about five minutes.</p>
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary class="faq-q">What happens when I hit my monthly limit?</summary>
          <div class="faq-a">
            <p>You get a push notification at 80% so you're never surprised. If you hit the cap, AI drafting pauses — you can still send and receive texts normally. Upgrade anytime mid-month; limits reset immediately.</p>
          </div>
        </details>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ================== FINAL CTA ================== -->
  <section class="big-cta" id="get">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="eyebrow">Beta open now</div>
      <h2 class="display">Reply faster.<br />Win more jobs.</h2>
      <div class="ctas">
        <a href="mailto:hi@foremann.app?subject=Beta%20access" class="btn btn-primary">Get your business number</a>
        <a href="#how" class="btn btn-secondary">See how it works</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
